abstract: >-
  highFIS is a PyTorch-based library for high-dimensional
  Takagi-Sugeno-Kang (TSK) fuzzy systems. It provides
  differentiable fuzzy inference, numerical stability, and
  scikit-learn compatible estimators for classification
  and regression, covering thirteen model families from
  the literature.
